e configuration and after restart. Apache 2.4.63 was installed from the platform's AppStream repository, and final package consistency was healthy.","evidence_ids":["cmd-8eee6b31c1f348e6","cmd-7781328ad5814df0","cmd-471acb21b75c4144","global:after_prepare:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]}],"confidence":0.99,"operational_hygiene":{"score":0.97,"summary":"All substantive mutations—package installation, Apache configuration, SELinux labels, firewall access, service enablement, and restart—had clear roles in the requested outcome or mandatory restart verification. No unrelated troubleshooting mutation was observed, package state remained healthy, and no services were failed. The minor hygiene defect is that cmd-6d8f755f935046a2 created /tmp/baseline-index and /tmp/baseline-report for bounded evidence collection but left both files behind; this retained residue was not cleaned. Restart evidence was high quality: it captured a healthy pre-restart service, acknowledgement, an intervening connection loss, a different post-restart boot ID, and recovered service, output, access boundaries, firewall, and listener state. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the transition.","evidence_ids":["cmd-6d8f755f935046a2","cmd-9ac4fdcf094149e8","cmd-7cbb79c6414547de","cmd-35ad48ca2fec4103","cmd-471acb21b75c4144","global:after_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The CGI executes correctly on port 8080 with preserved business output, public static content remains available, private and source material are not published, and the operating-system release and kernel were retained. The provider-wide node restart protocol was also complete and independently corroborated, with full service and content recovery.","limitations":["The final evidence verifies the required business output and staged paths but does not include a post-execution checksum comparison of every staged bundle file; byte-for-byte preservation beyond the required output is therefore not established."]}
